      "side": 1,
      "message": "[error] Line 159: 🔴 `canRemoveEverywhere()` compares `document.author` to `accountService.getAccount(path.accountId)?.uri` verbatim. If the daemon reports the author as the raw Jami ID while the account URI includes a scheme/prefix, authors will not see the remove-for-everyone action even though the daemon allows it. Normalize both identities to the same representation used elsewhere for conversation/member comparisons before comparing.",
      "revId": "3057510d2de4c8dcd52d2632d64551e23f9e9063",
      "serverId": "1e26b4c1-6b8c-47ff-9df7-501b633d3b5a"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "80f4b2bb_3b4eeb8b",
        "filename": "jami-android/app/src/main/java/cx/ring/fragments/CollabDocumentsFragment.kt",
